<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμν-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
		prop. fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>naked,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				448
			</span></i>: also with masc. Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. στόλος ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					105
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>trained, exercised,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδὶ γυμνάδος ἵππου</span> (restored
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνάδας ἵππους</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1134
			</span></i>(lyr.): masc., <i>trained, practised,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφ᾽ ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.1322
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνασία</span>
			 or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνάσιον, γυμνάδος ἐν τεμένει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).447
				</span></i>
			 (Amorg.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				12(3).202
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Astypalaea</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνάδος . . πόνον ἐκτελέσαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Cos</u>
					419.5
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				28.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
